er professionals may have privileged access to important systems and data","isCorrect":true,"position":0},{"id":"d409c9f5-fa1a-5fd8-97b2-2774f5cc3ea3","text":"They prevent hardware from aging","isCorrect":false,"position":1},{"id":"56017848-e191-5fdf-ba18-3f2508526447","text":"They make every program error-free","isCorrect":false,"position":2},{"id":"4dda5a8f-a5ea-5389-a856-4f91b5f721f0","text":"They replace technical competence","isCorrect":false,"position":3}]},{"id":"9f8be609-a4ce-5f66-9bb3-ca81cc6e5389","position":165,"prompt":"A nightly processing job finishes, but no backup is produced. Which professional duty was neglected?","explanation":"Regular backups are part of dependable system operation and recovery preparation.","questionKind":"application","difficulty":"medium","cognitive":"application","topic":"Computing Disciplines, Careers and Professional Ethics","fingerprint":"655d47aa4736444ad957ff4affeaf900a321d8229f89696765e74af45613ee37","studyRef":{"sourceLabel":"COS 101 lecture note, Module Seven","sourceKind":"supplied_material","reviewedFromLocalFile":true},"generationMeta":{"import":"codex_cos101_200_v1","sourceReference":"COS 101 lecture note, Module Seven","technicalAccuracyReviewCompleted":true,"humanVerificationRequired":true},"options":[{"id":"f155e4e3-f35a-5fff-88da-7ccd21f8a0b3","text":"Graphic design","isCorrect":false,"position":0},{"id":"efb13be9-d7d2-5784-bdaa-74dd27d046f7","text":"Internet domain registration","isCorrect":false,"position":1},{"id":"7b6be054-0ae1-5ddb-9cdd-ad52566b2b98","text":"Computer classification","isCorrect":false,"position":2},{"id":"5525442d-2ac7-5e3c-9685-1fbf41d0a682","text":"Routine operational data protection","isCorrect":true,"position":3}]},{"id":"9ecb0fa5-2b62-5bac-aec9-48c960f52ac1","position":166,"prompt":"Why can membership in a professional body be valuable?","explanation":"Professional communities promote learning, ethical expectations and shared practice.","questionKind":"application","difficulty":"mediu