ord","isCorrect":false,"position":0},{"id":"79f2b9dc-4099-50d9-a59d-77ee61a3d5cd","text":"Remove every audit record","isCorrect":false,"position":1},{"id":"377970fd-53d6-56eb-9639-11874473e724","text":"Assume technical access gives unlimited permission","isCorrect":false,"position":2},{"id":"9bfeb74a-7056-54dc-b316-7f066cd63ac1","text":"Limit privileged access, log its use and require legitimate authorization","isCorrect":true,"position":3}]},{"id":"7719e504-297e-5327-8b21-b8566cbd2c5b","position":174,"prompt":"An automated hiring tool disadvantages one group. What should the computing team do?","explanation":"Professional responsibility includes evaluating system impact and correcting unfair or unsafe behaviour.","questionKind":"application","difficulty":"hard","cognitive":"analysis","topic":"Computing Disciplines, Careers and Professional Ethics","fingerprint":"065848fe1b85ef34d1bac05b5e21dc66f13c7172ed1facfb82e4a75ed9460108","studyRef":{"sourceLabel":"General COS 101 enrichment: Computing Disciplines, Careers and Professional Ethics","sourceKind":"general_cos101","reviewedFromLocalFile":false},"generationMeta":{"import":"codex_cos101_200_v1","sourceReference":"General COS 101 enrichment: Computing Disciplines, Careers and Professional Ethics","technicalAccuracyReviewCompleted":true,"humanVerificationRequired":true},"options":[{"id":"6f51da25-0339-5da2-b299-a48e988630a7","text":"Assume software cannot discriminate","isCorrect":false,"position":0},{"id":"0ad77f94-c2c6-5d07-96b4-0fc5081043e9","text":"Remove all appeal mechanisms","isCorrect":false,"position":1},{"id":"63aafb98-2474-518a-b2f4-a6882d0920b5","text":"Investigate data and outcomes, mitigate bias and provide accountable human review","isCorrect":true,"position":2},{"id":"d5f0fe63-5f4c-54f9-a2b1-87101a3b13ff","text":"Hide the result differences","isCorrect":false,"position":3}]},{"id":"7785d9ce-2e1d-5d80-9a2b-bb6460a041d1","position":175,"prompt":"What does artificial intelligence seek to enable machines t